{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_f9549a5473062ca1-557\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>TVB 小花鍾翠詩向來深受大批網民與粉絲喜愛。隨着天氣轉涼，她在社交平台大晒一段山林行山的動態影片，展現滿滿的健康活力。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f9549a5473062ca1-557\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_f9549a5473062ca1-558\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>影片中，鍾翠詩身穿一整套全白色的運動造型，包括白色低胸運動 Bra Top搭配同色短裙，在樹林小徑間興奮小跑並向鏡頭開心揮手打招呼，大晒健康身材，臉上更掛着招牌甜美笑容，場面既清新又性感。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f9549a5473062ca1-558\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b73c0618-1ebd-4ea0-8f21-be07f437774c.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20267AnmQCe6yn1791342127.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b73c0618-1ebd-4ea0-8f21-be07f437774c.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e911e68b-c1a3-48d6-a5e0-4819d255c12b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026IyWJXtGN5G1791342126.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e911e68b-c1a3-48d6-a5e0-4819d255c12b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_f9549a5473062ca1-558\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_f9549a5473062ca1-559\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>鍾翠詩亦在帖文中感性留言，邀請粉絲一同享受戶外好天氣：「今日終於有啲秋意啦🍂準備好同我一齊行山未啊？🥰」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T03:20:22.117526+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}